    "commentaryEn": "Syntax: Kuryāddhi bhajanam kurvan kriyā āgnā’nusārataha;\nKriyā-bandhah kriyā-bhārah kriyāmānas-tato na hi. 124\n\nPurport: One should perform tasks while engaging in devotion and according to āgnā . By doing so, one will not become attached to one’s actions, be burdened by them or develop ego because of them. (124)",
