    "commentaryEn": "Syntax: Suhṛud-bhāvena bhaktānām shubha-guṇa-gaṇān smaret;\nNa grāhyo’vaguṇas-teṣhām drohah kāryo na sarvathā. 168\n\nPurport: With suhradaybhāv , recollect the virtues of devotees. One should never view their flaws or offend them in any way. (168)",
