    "commentaryEn": "Syntax: Vivādah kalaho vā’pi naiva kāryah kadāchana;\nVartitavyam vivekena rakṣhyā shāntish-cha sarvadā. 170\n\nPurport: One should never argue or quarrel with anyone. One should always be well-mannered and remain calm. (170)",
