    "commentaryEn": "Syntax: Anna-falādibhish-chaiva yathā-shakti jalādibhihi;\nPālitāh pashu-pakṣhyādyāh sambhāvyā hi yathochitam. 197\n\nPurport: According to one’s means, one should provide suitable food, fruits, water and other sustenance for one’s domesticated animals and birds. (197)",
