    "sanskritIast": "Chaitra-shukla-navamyām hi kāryam Shrī-Rāma-pūjanam;\nKṛuṣhṇā’ṣhṭamyām tu kartavyam Shrāvaṇe Kṛuṣhṇa-pūjanam. 248",
